{{define "publisher.html.tmpl"}}{{template "head" .L.Publisher}}<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{.Prefix}}style.css">
</head>
<body>
<header><p><a href="{{.Prefix}}index.html">PantherClaw marketplace</a></p><h1>Publisher <code>{{.L.Publisher}}</code></h1></header>
<main>
{{template "notice"}}
{{with .L}}<section>
<h2>About this listing</h2>
<dl>
<dt>Publisher id</dt><dd><code>{{.Publisher}}</code></dd>
<dt>Name given by the publisher</dt><dd>{{.DisplayName}}</dd>
<dt>Homepage given by the publisher</dt><dd><a href="{{.Homepage}}" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer">{{.Homepage}}</a></dd>
</dl>
</section>
<section>
<h2>1. Pin the publisher's key</h2>
<p>Check each fingerprint with the publisher through a channel you already trust, not only through this page. Download the key file, then pin it: pclaw refuses a key whose fingerprint differs. Pinning creates a pending pin; an org admin confirms it with a security key on the link <code>pclaw</code> prints.</p>
{{range .Keys}}<dl>
<dt>Key id</dt><dd><code>{{.KID}}</code></dd>
<dt>Fingerprint (SHA-256)</dt><dd><code class="digest">{{.Fingerprint}}</code></dd>
<dt>Key file</dt><dd><a href="{{.PubFile}}" download>{{.PubFile}}</a></dd>
</dl>
<pre><code>pclaw publisher pin --publisher {{$.L.Publisher}} --key-file {{.PubFile}} --fingerprint {{.Fingerprint}}</code></pre>
{{end}}</section>
<section>
<h2>2. Install a bundle</h2>
{{if .Bundles}}<table>
<thead><tr><th>Bundle</th><th>Version</th><th>Summary</th><th>Download</th><th>SHA-256</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
{{range .Bundles}}<tr>
<td><code>{{.Name}}</code></td>
<td>{{.Version}}</td>
<td>{{.Summary}}</td>
<td><a href="{{.URL}}" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer">{{.URL}}</a></td>
<td><code class="digest">{{.SHA256}}</code></td>
</tr>
{{end}}</tbody>
</table>
<p>Download the file, check its SHA-256 against the digest above, then:</p>
{{range .Bundles}}<pre><code>pclaw bundle verify {{.Name}}-{{.Version}}.pcbundle --public-key KEY_FILE.pub --fingerprint FINGERPRINT
pclaw bundle install {{.Name}}-{{.Version}}.pcbundle</code></pre>
{{end}}<p>The install is refused unless the bundle is signed by a key your org pinned and confirmed for this publisher. What it installs lands as drafts; nothing runs until your org reviews and signs it.</p>
{{else}}<p>This publisher lists no bundles yet.</p>
{{end}}</section>
{{end}}</main>
{{template "foot"}}{{end}}
